OL,3,GNEWSABusway project reduced in size
OL,4,Aafter feedback
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed new busway has been reduced
OL,7,Fin size after concerns were raised, a
OL,8,Fmeeting has heard.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire County Council wants to
OL,11,Fbuild a busway between Cambridge's
OL,12,FBiomedical Campus and a new travel hub
OL,13,Foff the A11.
OL,15,FA public inquiry examining the plans is
OL,16,Fdue to get under way in December.
OL,18,FAt a pre-inquiry meeting on Tuesday,
OL,19,Fthe council's barrister Alexander Booth
OL,20,FKC said the area of land to be acquired
OL,21,Fas part of the project had been
OL,22,Freduced.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
